Package: RADAR
Type: Package
Title: Raman Spectral Analysis Using Deep Learning for Artifact Removal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joel", "Sjoberg", email = "joelsjoberg3@gmail.com", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original algorithms, neural networks and pretrained weights"),
    person("Bogdan", "Oancea", email = "bogdan.oancea@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Decomposes Raman spectra into baseline, cosmic rays, noise and
    Raman peaks using the bundled pretrained standard and ensemble convolutional
    networks. Implements neural network inference, automatic differentiation,
    training, synthetic data generation, evaluation and spectral file conversion
    entirely in R. Includes
    readers and writers for common spectroscopy and scientific data formats.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, stats, utils, tools
Suggests: jsonlite, hdf5r, DBI, RSQLite, readxl, openxlsx, arrow, xml2,
    knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
NeedsCompilation: no
LazyData: false
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
